<title>UK: RUGBY LEAGUE-BRADFORD BEAT LONDON IN CHALLENGE CUP.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-BRADFORD BEAT LONDON IN CHALLENGE CUP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bradford beat London 34-12 (halftime 10-2) in a Challenge Cup fifth round match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>London - Tries: Krause, Roskell. Goals: Barwick (2)</p>
<p>Bradford - Tries: Nickle (2), Cook, Loughlin, Paul, Tomlinson. Goals: McNamara (5).</p>
